[PrintTextModified Text:"我和蕾雅来到了招待所的<br>【<ruby=\"UNDINE\">水精</ruby>之室】。|#0204Adv08_Narrative001|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然没发现典狱长……|#0204Adv08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，真巧啊！<br>这不是蕾雅和希罗吗！|#0204Adv08_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但发现了雪莉。|#0204Adv08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉该不会是<br>来探索地下的？|#0204Adv08_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:答对了！<br>说到调查的话，果然还是这里最合适！|#0204Adv08_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:正好你们来了，<br>要不要一起去地下探索？|#0204Adv08_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长确实有可能在地下。|#0204Adv08_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，毕竟那里<br>有不少能操控监牢机关的装置。|#0204Adv08_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:好吧，我也去。|#0204Adv08_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了！<br>那我们赶紧出发吧！|#0204Adv08_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
