[PrintTextModified Text:——我们沿着秘密楼梯，下楼来到半地下层，<br>三人一同乘上了电梯。|#0204Adv08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:2 Duration:0.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:31_2
