[PrintTextModified Text:……然而。|#0204Adv08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; エレベーターブザー音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_146 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:警示音响起，<br>电梯纹丝不动。|#0204Adv08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了，<br>这台电梯只能乘坐两个人……|#0204Adv08_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟这么老旧了……<br>没办法，我在这里等着，<br>你们两个去吧。|#0204Adv08_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Leia Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅发挥她的绅士风度，<br>飒爽地走出电梯。|#0204Adv08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:1

