[PrintTextModified Text:电梯成功启动了，希罗！<br>地下探索，出发出发！|#0204Adv08_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（老实说……宁愿在外面等的是我）|#0204Adv08_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@StopBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 FadeOutDuration:10

[PrintTextModified Text:话说，<br>这个电梯里是不是有点热？|#0204Adv08_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉一边用手向自己扇风，<br>一边说道。|#0204Adv08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv08_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我假装没听见。|#0204Adv08_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:这里的氛围好诡异啊。<br>感觉像是会就这么直接通往异世界……<br>你听说过吗？关于电梯的都市怪谈。|#0204Adv08_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv08_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里全是怪事，<br>试试照我说的，说不定真的能行哦！<br>异世界耶！|#0204Adv08_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv08_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:都说到这里了，实在是心痒痒！<br>要不要试试看！？<br>异世界电梯耶！|#0204Adv08_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv08_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我实在是好奇得不得了啦！<br>来吧来吧！|#0204Adv08_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我——|#0204Adv08_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

