[PrintTextModified Text:别胡闹了。<br>我们是来探索地下设施的，<br>别忘了正事。|#0204Adv08_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我终于忍不住开口，制止了雪莉。|#0204Adv08_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Flushed1

